From 7d77c28ab93a1181ba6118d9d68035453d21b7bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dsv41 <dsv41@local>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:22:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] [AMD] DSV4.1: OPUS sparse prefill on gfx950 (opt-in,
 SGLANG_OPT_DSV41_OPUS_PREFILL=1)

Route large DSV4.1 EXTEND/MIXED prefill batches in the HIP radix backend to aiter's
pa_sparse_prefill_opus (same kernel vLLM uses for large sparse MLA prefill on gfx950).

- kernels/ops/attention/dsv4/opus_prefill_hip.py: Triton dequant-gather (packed 584 B fp8 row
  -> bf16 [512]), Triton CSR fill (request-local compressed positions + SWA window -> workspace
  rows), OpusPrefillRows (layer-invariant plan reused by every layer), opus_sparse_prefill.
- deepseek_v4_backend_hip_radix.py: _opus_prefill_eligible / _opus_prefill, tried before the
  aiter_sparse path; falls back when not eligible (CP, SWA replay, late-layer tail, capture, ...).
- environ.py: SGLANG_OPT_DSV41_OPUS_PREFILL (off), ..._MIN_TOKENS (2048), ..._MAX_WS_ROWS
  (524288), SGLANG_DEBUG_DSV41_OPUS_PREFILL_CHECK (bounds-check every index; syncs, debug only).
- test_hip_opus_prefill.py: vs aiter_sparse_decode_fwd, 3 requests incl. a 5000-token prefix.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
